    "committer": "cafletezbrant <cafletezbrant@gmail.com>",
    "message": "Replace HiCBricks with rhdf5 in getChrCGFromCools\n\nThe vignette build was segfaulting in H5close() called from\nHiCBricks::Create_many_Bricks_from_mcool. Reading mcool files\ndirectly via rhdf5 (already a dependency) avoids the crash and\nremoves HiCBricks as a dependency entirely.\n\nVerified output matches cgEx exactly (all.equal: TRUE).\n",
    "time": 1777236196
  },
